OL,3,ATrial of US mother accused of murdering
OL,4,Aher children hearing closing arguments
OL,5,
OL,6,FClosing arguments are under way in the
OL,7,Ftrial of Lindsay Clancy, an American
OL,8,Fmother accused of murdering her three
OL,9,Fchildren in Massachusetts in 2023 -
OL,10,Fhere's what you need to know
OL,12,FClancy, 36, is charged with three
OL,13,Fcounts of first-degree murder over the
OL,14,Fdeaths of Cora, five, Dawson, three,
OL,15,Fand eight-month-old Callan
OL,17,FClancy's attorney Kevin Reddington says
OL,18,Fthe children are victims of a
OL,19,F"horrible, horrific act" and the court
OL,20,Fhas heard some of the "toughest, most
OL,21,Fgut-wrenching" testimony in recent
OL,22,Fweeks
OL,23,APub: 27-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,316,300,200,140,0,100
