OL,3,ATrial of US mother accused of murdering
OL,4,Aher children hearing closing arguments
OL,5,
OL,6,FProsecutors allege the former labour
OL,7,Fand delivery nurse intentionally
OL,8,Fstrangled and killed her children
OL,10,FClancy has not disputed that she killed
OL,11,Fher children, but her lawyers argue she
OL,12,Fshould not be held legally responsible
OL,13,Fbecause she was suffering from
OL,14,Fpostpartum psychosis
OL,16,FThe jury will soon decide the outcome
OL,17,Fof this case - what options do they
OL,18,Fhave?
